# Cloudflare Pages custom headers.
#
# Story pages are loaded via Barba soft-navigation: clicking a link does a
# background fetch() of the page HTML and swaps <main> in place. A background
# fetch can be served from a stale browser/edge cache WITHOUT revalidating,
# which is why clicking a story from stories.html could show an old version
# while a direct reload showed the current one.
#
# no-cache still lets the file be cached, but forces a freshness check on every
# request, so soft-navigation can never swap in a stale page. (Assets like the
# narration mp3s live outside short_stories/ and keep normal caching.)
/short_stories/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache
